msgid ":q closes the window (:q! without asking about its tabs), :qa quits Beluga, :e or :cd PATH opens a folder, :tabnew [PATH], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp or :vs [PATH] split the view, :only closes the other view, :mkdir NAME, :touch NAME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMMAND runs a shell command in the folder."
msgstr ":q lukkar vindauget (:q! utan å spørja om fanene), :qa avsluttar Beluga, :e eller :cd STIG opnar ei mappe, :tabnew [STIG], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp eller :vs [STIG] deler visinga, :only lukkar den andre visinga, :mkdir NAMN, :touch NAMN, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!KOMMANDO køyrer ein skalkommando i mappa."

